# era-finance-core module map

**Acceptance SSOT:** [Finance-Acceptance-System](../../../docs/acceptance/Finance-Acceptance-System.md) · [Product-Readiness](../../../docs/acceptance/Finance-Product-Readiness-Matrix.md) · [Implementation-Matrix](../../../docs/acceptance/Finance-Implementation-Matrix.md)

## Accounting / GL

| Route | API |
|-------|-----|
| `/accounting/books` | `GET/POST /api/accounting/books`, `GET /api/accounting/books/slots`, `GET /api/accounting/books/:id`; slot-gated extra books; TEMPLATE / EMPTY / NAS_CLONE CoA strategies; optional statutory translation DRAFT; header book selector via `ledger-context` (`ledgerType` + `accountingBookId` alias) |
| `/accounting/chart` | NAS/IFRS CoA; `GET /api/accounts?ledgerType=`; NAS import; `POST /api/accounts/ifrs-provision`, `POST /api/accounts/ifrs`; ops `POST /api/accounts/ifrs-mirror` |
| `/accounting/ledger-mappings` | Versioned arbitrary book-pair LedgerMappingSet UI/API; source-book fan-out to every PUBLISHED target, per-set outcomes, soft/strict policy; NAS_TO_IFRS primary/fallback compatibility |
| `/accounting/adjustments` | Manual journals; `ledgerType` NAS\|IFRS (P1) |
| `/accounting/mapping` | redirect → ledger-mappings |
| `/accounting/ifrs-mapping` | redirect → ledger-mappings |
| `/accounting/posting-roles` | `GET/PATCH /api/accounting/posting-roles` |
| `/accounting/adjustments` | Manual voucher: `GET/POST /api/accounting/manual-adjustments`, `GET …/:id`, `GET …/:id/pdf`, `POST …/preview`, `POST …/:id/reverse`, `GET …/templates`; basis links + PDF + reverse — ADR [finance-manual-adjusting-journal.md](../../../docs/adr/finance-manual-adjusting-journal.md) wave 3 |
| `/sales/invoices` (ViewInvoiceModal) | `POST /api/invoices/:id/credit-adjustment` — internal remaining credit (wave 2–3 VAT split REVENUE); overpayment CTA → adjustments; extra attributes JSONB (not GL); Print → `/print/invoice/:id` |
| `/sales/invoices` (register) | `GET /api/invoices` whitelist `status`/`dueFrom`/`dueTo`/`sortKey`/`sortDir`; `GET/POST/PATCH/DELETE /api/saved-list-views` — ADR extensibility W2 saved views (not SQL) |
| `/settings/extra-fields` | `GET/POST/PATCH /api/extra-fields`, `PUT /api/extra-fields/values/FINANCE_INVOICE/:id` — ADR [extensibility-forms-print-reports](../../../docs/adr/extensibility-forms-print-reports.md) W1 |
| `/settings/print-placeholders` | Read-only whitelist catalog for `FINANCE_INVOICE_COMMERCIAL` — ADR extensibility W3 |
| `/print/invoice/:id` | `GET /api/invoices/:id/print-snapshot`, `GET /api/invoices/:id/print-html` — commercial invoice vendor HTML (not fiscal) |
| `/fixed-assets` | lifecycle journal ref → adjustments; `?asset=` deep link (wave 3) |
| `/reporting/journal` | `GET /api/reporting/general-ledger` (read-only) |
| `/reporting/compare-books` | `GET /api/reporting/compare-books?bookA=&bookB=&dateFrom=&dateTo=`; book-scoped trial-balance comparison |
| `/audit-hub/reconciliation` | `GET /api/audit-hub/reconciliation/nas-ifrs`; compatibility route comparing default ops book with every ACTIVE non-ops book for presence and debit parity |
| `/expenses/quick` | `POST /api/accounting/quick-expense` (fixed 731/101) |

Roles for posting: Post/Approve = `api:ledger.post` (CP JWT grants via Nest `PermissionsGuard` + web `can()` — ADR [finance-domain-permissions-and-rbac](../../../docs/adr/finance-domain-permissions-and-rbac.md)). Matrix UI = Orchestrator `/settings/access` (no Finance local access matrix). `AuditorMutationGuard` locked belt on donor `AUDITOR`. USER / packages without `api:ledger.post` cannot post journal vouchers.

