## Trade credit (Phase 0–2 domain API)

ADR: [finance-trade-credit-control.md](../../../docs/adr/finance-trade-credit-control.md), [finance-trade-credit-factor-lead.md](../../../docs/adr/finance-trade-credit-factor-lead.md). SKUs `trade_credit_control` + optional `trade_credit_factor_lead`. Domain API + staff UI (`/crm/trade-credit`, counterparty facility section with А–Г + Deep check) + Wholesale confirm consume + buyer SSO cabinet (`/buyer` PWA).

| Route / surface | API |
|-----------------|-----|
| Counterparties (staff) | `GET/PUT /api/counterparties/:id/trade-credit` — staff view includes A–D policy fields |
| Enrichment (staff) | `GET/POST /api/counterparties/:id/trade-credit/enrichment` — finance-only; meter `TRADE_CREDIT_ENRICH`; soft ceiling disables Deep check |
| Facilities (staff) | `GET /api/trade-credit/facilities?policyGroup=` — staff-safe list (effective group) |
| Grants (staff) | `POST /api/trade-credit/grants`, `POST /api/trade-credit/grants/:id/void`, `GET /api/trade-credit/grants` |
| Policy (staff) | `GET/PUT /api/trade-credit/policy` (Phase 3 knobs: `limitK`, `trialLimitAzn`, haircuts, `enrichTtlDays`, `restoreProposalEnabled`, …); `POST .../policy/pin`, `accept-raise`, `reject-raise`, `restore-after-block`, `reclassify` |
| Limit decisions (staff) | `GET /api/trade-credit/limit-decisions` — Accept/Reject feedback + 30d DPD follow-up (finance-only) |
| Buyer invite (staff) | `POST /api/counterparties/:id/trade-credit/invite` → Orch `/buyer-portal/invite` (VÖEN required) |
| Buyer SSO | `POST /api/auth/buyer-sso/exchange` (web + Nest); cookie `era_buyer_session` |
| Buyer cabinet API | `GET /api/buyer/trade-credit` (+ `factorLeadEnabled`); `POST .../grants`; `GET .../grants/:id`; `GET .../invoices`; `POST .../invoices/:id/pay-link`; `GET/PUT .../notify-prefs`; `POST .../factor-leads` — **no** `policyGroup` |
| Internal consume | `POST /api/internal/v1/trade-credit/grants/consume` (service token) |
| Meter stub | `TradeCreditMeterService.snapshotBilledBuyers` — soft `TRADE_CREDIT_BUYER` overage; enrich soft `TRADE_CREDIT_ENRICH` |

Mutate roles: OWNER / ADMIN / ACCOUNTANT. SKU off → **402** `TRADE_CREDIT_REQUIRED`. Do not expose A–D on sales or buyer APIs.

